  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FGMC Programme Management and Support (PMST Bridge 2023-24)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the services will be to manage completion and closure of the &#x201C;bridge&#x201D; phase of the Forest Governance Markets and Climate (FGMC) programme, by enabling delivery of priorities for 2023-24. The Supplier will assist FCDO to oversee and manage aspects of FGMC implementation, including: (i) responsibility for financial and performance oversight of a few strategic Accountable FGMC Grants; (ii) performance oversight of projects providing technical support in partner countries as indicated by the SRO; (iii) preparation of comprehensive reports of FGMC learning, actions and spending over the past decade creating a legacy of information resources that may be accessed to inform future programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
